42
00:01:43,160 --> 00:01:48,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The last time was Walk-on-Water Jutsu,
so is it gonna be Walk-on-Fire Jutsu?</font>

43
00:01:49,380 --> 00:01:52,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Or maybe Walk-in-the-Air?</font>

44
00:01:54,210 --> 00:01:57,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hurry up and tell me, Pervy Sage!</font>

45
00:01:58,220 --> 00:02:01,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You keep calling me Pervy Sage.</font>

46
00:02:01,260 --> 00:02:04,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So you have no idea that
I'm a superb person, huh?</font>

47
00:02:04,390 --> 00:02:06,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh...? A superb Pervy Sage?</font>

48
00:02:09,390 --> 00:02:10,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Listen carefully!</font>

49
00:02:12,360 --> 00:02:14,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Toad Sage is only a disguise!</font>

50
00:02:15,990 --> 00:02:19,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As a matter of fact...!</font>

51
00:02:20,490 --> 00:02:22,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">North and South and East and West!</font>

52
00:02:24,370 --> 00:02:26,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm the white-maned toad charmer,</font>

53
00:02:26,120 --> 00:02:29,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and one of the legendary Sannin whom
even celestial beings can't defeat.</font>

54
00:02:29,830 --> 00:02:31,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Such a stud!</font>

55
00:02:31,080 --> 00:02:33,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That he strikes fear...
in the hearts of people!</font>

56
00:02:33,090 --> 00:02:35,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I am no other than "Jiraiya-sama"!</font>

57
00:02:36,920 --> 00:02:41,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes...
I'm talking about me!</font>

58
00:02:43,850 --> 00:02:44,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh...</font>

59
00:03:03,160 --> 00:03:09,160
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Oh, No-!</font>

60
00:03:03,160 --> 00:03:09,160
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Jiraiya's Woman Trouble,</font>

61
00:03:03,160 --> 00:03:09,160
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Naruto's Trouble</font>

62
00:03:14,670 --> 00:03:18,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Atafuku Town?
That's ten kilometers from here!</font>

63
00:03:18,760 --> 00:03:21,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's "O"tafuku Town!</font>

64
00:03:21,510 --> 00:03:25,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey... hey...
Hey, Pervy Sage!</font>

65
00:03:26,060 --> 00:03:29,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm telling you, it's Jiraiya.
Gimme a break...</font>

66
00:03:29,810 --> 00:03:31,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So the fact that such
a bigwig Pervy Sage like you</font>

67
00:03:32,020 --> 00:03:35,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">is taking me along as
his travel companion means...</font>

68
00:03:35,690 --> 00:03:38,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that I'm potentially a genius?</font>

69
00:03:38,940 --> 00:03:40,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just as I thought!</font>

70
00:03:43,870 --> 00:03:46,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! Hey! Hey!
Why did you choose me?</font>

71
00:03:48,950 --> 00:03:53,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A long time ago,
the Fourth Hokage was my disciple.</font>

72
00:03:56,000 --> 00:04:00,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And you resemble the Fourth Hokage
so much, it's almost funny.</font>

73
00:04:00,760 --> 00:04:04,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's the only reason...</font>

74
00:04:04,930 --> 00:04:06,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I...?</font>

75
00:04:07,560 --> 00:04:09,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Fourth Hokage...?</font>

76
00:04:11,890 --> 00:04:13,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah!</font>

77
00:04:13,190 --> 00:04:14,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah! Yeah!</font>

78
00:04:14,980 --> 00:04:16,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-What is it?</font>

79
00:04:16,860 --> 00:04:18,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah!</font>

80
00:04:18,820 --> 00:04:20,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The fact that I resemble
the Fourth Hokage means</font>

81
00:04:20,990 --> 00:04:23,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that I also possess genius
of his level, right?</font>

82
00:04:23,450 --> 00:04:26,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll become the Hokage, after all!
All right!</font>

83
00:04:35,210 --> 00:04:37,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-Wait...</font>

84
00:04:41,960 --> 00:04:43,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I stepped on some dog poop!</font>

85
00:04:46,800 --> 00:04:49,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">About the only areas you resemble
the Fourth Hokage</font>

86
00:04:49,180 --> 00:04:51,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">are your hair and your stubbornness!</font>

87
00:04:52,560 --> 00:04:55,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What was that?!
You senile Pervy Sage!</font>

88
00:04:56,980 --> 00:04:58,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Not again!</font>

89
00:05:13,540 --> 00:05:15,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura? Come here!</font>

90
00:05:15,920 --> 00:05:16,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay!</font>

91
00:05:17,460 --> 00:05:19,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please take these rice sweets
over to Ino-chan's house.</font>

92
00:05:20,550 --> 00:05:21,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ino's house?</font>

93
00:05:22,760 --> 00:05:23,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">These?</font>

94
00:05:23,460 --> 00:05:24,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right...</font>

95
00:05:25,300 --> 00:05:27,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't bother them
by staying too long.</font>

96
00:05:27,930 --> 00:05:29,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Because everyone is
very busy at this time.</font>

97
00:05:30,390 --> 00:05:31,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I know that!</font>

98
00:05:31,930 --> 00:05:33,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">See you later!</font>

99
00:05:39,610 --> 00:05:40,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, yeah...</font>

100
00:05:40,860 --> 00:05:43,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll bring some over
to Sasuke-kun later on too.</font>

101
00:05:43,900 --> 00:05:45,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wonder if he likes sweets...?</font>

102
00:05:46,280 --> 00:05:48,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And to Naruto too...</font>

103
00:05:48,280 --> 00:05:50,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto looks like
he would eat anything...</font>

104
00:05:54,950 --> 00:05:58,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey Kakashi-sensei!
Teach me Chidori too!</font>

105
00:05:58,420 --> 00:06:02,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You may say teach me,
but it's not that easy.</font>

106
00:06:02,460 --> 00:06:03,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What the hell's that?!</font>

107
00:06:03,840 --> 00:06:05,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's not fair, show me how!
Teach it to me.</font>

108
00:06:06,800 --> 00:06:09,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun... Thank you...</font>

109
00:06:09,800 --> 00:06:13,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You rescued me from
the Sand Ninja, right?</font>

110
00:06:16,270 --> 00:06:17,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No...</font>

111
00:06:17,270 --> 00:06:18,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

112
00:06:21,730 --> 00:06:25,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For a start, why don't you try gathering
Chakra in your palms!</font>

113
00:06:25,480 --> 00:06:26,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right!</font>

114
00:06:28,860 --> 00:06:32,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The person who rescued you...
was Naruto.</font>

115
00:06:35,080 --> 00:06:37,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Like this? Like this?</font>

116
00:06:38,160 --> 00:06:41,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh come on, Sasuke-kun,
you're being overmodest again.</font>

117
00:06:42,960 --> 00:06:46,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's true that Naruto has gotten stronger,
but against that Sand Ninja...</font>

118
00:06:46,380 --> 00:06:47,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm telling you the truth.</font>

119
00:06:52,300 --> 00:06:57,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That kid fought desperately
to rescue you.</font>

120
00:06:57,890 --> 00:07:00,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He showed a kind of strength that
he had never shown before.</font>

121
00:07:01,980 --> 00:07:06,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto rescued... me.</font>

122
00:07:10,360 --> 00:07:12,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, it's coming...</font>

123
00:07:13,200 --> 00:07:20,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Chidori! Huh? Chidori! Chidori!</font>

124
00:07:22,040 --> 00:07:24,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right! I'll bring some to Naruto too!</font>

125
00:07:40,770 --> 00:07:45,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wasn't...
I wasn't able to do anything...</font>

126
00:07:46,770 --> 00:07:53,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't want to watch a precious comrade
die right before my eyes ever again...</font>

127
00:07:55,910 --> 00:08:02,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No matter what,
I will protect you!</font>

128
00:08:03,540 --> 00:08:06,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Multi-Shadow Clone Jutsu!</font>

129
00:08:12,800 --> 00:08:14,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Summoning Jutsu!</font>

130
00:08:24,150 --> 00:08:27,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto is getting stronger and stronger.</font>

131
00:08:28,440 --> 00:08:31,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Compared to him, I...</font>

132
00:08:51,760 --> 00:08:54,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">While you may able to
manage against him,</font>

133
00:08:54,760 --> 00:08:57,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I couldn't possibly...</font>

134
00:08:57,800 --> 00:08:59,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's on a completely different level...</font>

135
00:09:00,060 --> 00:09:01,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah...</font>

136
00:09:01,310 --> 00:09:04,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If we go at each other,
we'll either both be killed or at best,</font>

137
00:09:04,890 --> 00:09:07,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">kill each other simultaneously.</font>

138
00:09:08,110 --> 00:09:12,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even if we increased the numbers,
that wouldn't change.</font>

139
00:09:12,570 --> 00:09:16,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I didn't expect the kid's guard
would be a legendary Sannin.</font>

140
00:09:16,660 --> 00:09:18,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">With him as the opponent...</font>

141
00:09:18,200 --> 00:09:20,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the names of Leaf Village's Uchiha Clan</font>

142
00:09:20,740 --> 00:09:24,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and the Seven Ninja Swordsmen
of Mist would be tarnished.</font>

143
00:09:25,460 --> 00:09:27,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah. However...</font>

144
00:09:28,170 --> 00:09:32,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Any strong one has a weakness...</font>

145
00:09:48,270 --> 00:09:50,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stop! You will get cursed!</font>

146
00:09:54,110 --> 00:09:56,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, hey, Pervy Sage...</font>

147
00:09:56,320 --> 00:09:57,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?!</font>

148
00:09:57,950 --> 00:10:00,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What kind of a student was
the Fourth Hokage?</font>

149
00:10:00,830 --> 00:10:02,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, I guess one could say</font>

150
00:10:02,370 --> 00:10:04,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that he developed to that extent
because he was my student...</font>

151
00:10:04,870 --> 00:10:09,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're one lucky guy
to be taught by me!</font>

152
00:10:10,170 --> 00:10:12,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Hmmm...
— Hmmm...</font>

153
00:10:12,710 --> 00:10:14,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you dubious?</font>

154
00:10:14,300 --> 00:10:16,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A good teacher will develop
good disciples.</font>

155
00:10:16,630 --> 00:10:18,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That goes without saying.</font>

156
00:10:18,430 --> 00:10:22,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then, then, who taught you,
Pervy Sage?</font>

157
00:10:22,760 --> 00:10:24,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Me?</font>

158
00:10:24,100 --> 00:10:26,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I learned from the Third Hokage.</font>

159
00:10:26,770 --> 00:10:28,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Third Hokage?</font>

160
00:10:28,600 --> 00:10:29,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right...</font>

161
00:10:29,850 --> 00:10:33,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Third Hokage was
still young and lively.</font>

162
00:10:33,730 --> 00:10:36,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— The Third Hokage... young and lively?
— The Third Hokage... young and lively?</font>

163
00:10:37,030 --> 00:10:40,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right!
I was young and lively too!</font>

164
00:10:41,120 --> 00:10:42,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Young and lively?!</font>

165
00:10:49,960 --> 00:10:52,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I... I got tangled up.</font>

166
00:10:52,170 --> 00:10:54,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">See... You got cursed...</font>

167
00:10:56,960 --> 00:10:59,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So you learned from Kakashi.</font>

168
00:10:59,630 --> 00:11:02,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then you experienced
the "Bell Training," right?</font>

169
00:11:03,100 --> 00:11:03,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh...?</font>

170
00:11:03,970 --> 00:11:06,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah! I did! Yes I did!</font>

171
00:11:16,320 --> 00:11:20,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Only I was tied to the tree trunk
and had one deuce of a time...</font>

172
00:11:20,400 --> 00:11:22,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What? You too?</font>

173
00:11:22,570 --> 00:11:24,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh? What do you mean
by "you too"?</font>

174
00:11:24,160 --> 00:11:24,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

175
00:11:24,910 --> 00:11:25,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What do you mean by "you too"?</font>

176
00:11:26,080 --> 00:11:29,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why don't you just hurry,
get up and return those things.</font>

177
00:11:29,620 --> 00:11:32,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even if you were to say that...
it's pretty difficult...</font>

178
00:11:37,920 --> 00:11:39,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There are two bells.</font>

179
00:11:39,670 --> 00:11:41,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The fact that there are
only two means...</font>

180
00:11:41,970 --> 00:11:43,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That one of us has to go
to the tree trunk...</font>

181
00:11:44,470 --> 00:11:46,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're quick on the uptake, Orochimaru.</font>

182
00:11:47,260 --> 00:11:49,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right! I'll make it!</font>

183
00:11:50,640 --> 00:11:53,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Come at me with the intent to kill!</font>

184
00:12:05,660 --> 00:12:08,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Jiraiya, I won the bet with you, didn't I?</font>

185
00:12:08,830 --> 00:12:11,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You got tied to the tree trunk,
after all.</font>

186
00:12:11,460 --> 00:12:12,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shut up!</font>

187
00:12:12,540 --> 00:12:14,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You flat-chested like a cutting board.</font>

188
00:12:15,040 --> 00:12:18,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What did you say?!
You nerdy perv!</font>

189
00:12:19,260 --> 00:12:22,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay, Okay, that's enough.</font>

190
00:12:22,130 --> 00:12:24,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tsunade and Orochimaru go home!</font>

191
00:12:24,090 --> 00:12:25,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay!</font>

192
00:12:37,060 --> 00:12:39,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You are hopeless...</font>

193
00:12:39,480 --> 00:12:44,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ninja shouldn't be getting caught in
obvious traps like that over and over again.</font>

194
00:12:44,110 --> 00:12:45,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But...</font>

195
00:12:45,320 --> 00:12:47,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why don't you learn a little
from Orochimaru?!</font>

196
00:12:48,530 --> 00:12:52,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sarutobi-sensei, you're always
saying Orochimaru, Orochimaru!</font>

197
00:12:52,540 --> 00:12:53,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hm?</font>

198
00:12:53,790 --> 00:12:57,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When it comes to snooping,
I'm really good at Transparency Jutsu.</font>

199
00:12:58,840 --> 00:13:00,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Gimme a break...</font>

200
00:13:00,170 --> 00:13:01,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't even wanna know</font>

201
00:13:01,960 --> 00:13:03,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">what level of Transparency Jutsu
you possess...</font>

202
00:13:03,300 --> 00:13:06,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've never been caught once!
And that's the truth!</font>

203
00:13:08,220 --> 00:13:13,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you're that sure of yourself,
I'll go with you next time...</font>

204
00:13:17,440 --> 00:13:19,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're such a lecher, Sarutobi-sensei...</font>

205
00:13:23,440 --> 00:13:24,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?! Huh?</font>

206
00:13:26,030 --> 00:13:27,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What, what?</font>

207
00:13:27,570 --> 00:13:28,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey!</font>

208
00:13:28,370 --> 00:13:30,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's so funny?! Pervy Sage!</font>

209
00:13:30,530 --> 00:13:31,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

210
00:13:31,540 --> 00:13:35,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's just as I said, a good teacher
will develop good disciples.</font>

211
00:13:36,040 --> 00:13:38,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh...? I don't understand
what you're saying!</font>

212
00:13:38,790 --> 00:13:41,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Come on, let's go.
Did you put it back properly?</font>

213
00:13:41,630 --> 00:13:43,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah, I fixed them!</font>

214
00:13:47,300 --> 00:13:48,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">See!</font>

215
00:14:05,320 --> 00:14:09,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It appears that they haven't
found Naruto yet.</font>

216
00:14:09,700 --> 00:14:12,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But don't you think that's strange?</font>

217
00:14:13,660 --> 00:14:16,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Those guys had already
infiltrated the village.</font>

218
00:14:17,160 --> 00:14:19,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It should be easy to find Naruto
in this village.</font>

219
00:14:21,790 --> 00:14:24,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Itachi knows Naruto's face.</font>

220
00:14:26,510 --> 00:14:27,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kakashi...</font>

221
00:14:32,890 --> 00:14:34,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why is Kakashi sleeping?</font>

222
00:14:35,060 --> 00:14:37,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Besides, only Jonin are gathering here...</font>

223
00:14:37,270 --> 00:14:39,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are you doing?
What in the world happened?!</font>

224
00:14:39,980 --> 00:14:42,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Nothing... in particular...</font>

225
00:14:42,820 --> 00:14:45,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is it true that that
Itachi has returned?!</font>

226
00:14:47,280 --> 00:14:49,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And moreover,
that he's after Naruto...?!</font>

227
00:14:53,530 --> 00:14:54,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh...</font>

228
00:14:55,490 --> 00:14:56,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Idiot...</font>

229
00:15:02,960 --> 00:15:05,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why does this always happen?!</font>

230
00:15:11,800 --> 00:15:16,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So that guy returned to this village?
And moreover, he's pursuing Naruto?</font>

231
00:15:16,350 --> 00:15:17,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What does all this mean?!</font>

232
00:15:27,690 --> 00:15:28,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun?!</font>

233
00:15:28,650 --> 00:15:29,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Where's Naruto?!</font>

234
00:15:29,860 --> 00:15:32,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh? I just got here too.</font>

235
00:15:32,870 --> 00:15:34,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wanted to give Naruto...</font>

236
00:15:35,030 --> 00:15:35,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Some sweets...?</font>

237
00:15:36,370 --> 00:15:38,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If Naruto is caught by that guy,
that will spell his end.</font>

238
00:15:40,460 --> 00:15:42,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm not gonna let him do that!</font>

239
00:15:42,920 --> 00:15:45,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, old man!
Naruto must have come here!</font>

240
00:15:46,000 --> 00:15:48,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And do you know
where he went after that?</font>

241
00:15:48,590 --> 00:15:50,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, Naruto, right...</font>

242
00:15:50,670 --> 00:15:52,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If I remember correctly...</font>

243
00:15:53,430 --> 00:15:55,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Jiraiya-san came here
around noon and...</font>

244
00:15:56,430 --> 00:16:00,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They ate ramen together,
and he said he was going somewhere...</font>

245
00:16:00,520 --> 00:16:01,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Where?!</font>

246
00:16:01,770 --> 00:16:06,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hmm... I think he said to a post station
some distance from the village...</font>

247
00:16:08,820 --> 00:16:11,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And then he left with Jiraiya-san.</font>

248
00:16:11,700 --> 00:16:12,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Jiraiya?</font>

249
00:16:13,910 --> 00:16:16,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Jiraiya — one of the genius Sannin.</font>

250
00:16:17,580 --> 00:16:19,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, in appearance,</font>

251
00:16:19,750 --> 00:16:22,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">he just looks like
a big white-haired old man.</font>

252
00:16:22,830 --> 00:16:25,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Big and white-haired...</font>

253
00:16:26,340 --> 00:16:27,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">H-Hey!</font>

254
00:16:28,090 --> 00:16:31,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Jeez... If you're gonna
ask somebody a question,</font>

255
00:16:31,260 --> 00:16:33,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it's only polite to stay
and have a ramen or something.</font>

256
00:16:46,560 --> 00:16:48,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Candies are here.</font>

257
00:16:54,530 --> 00:16:57,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This town is pretty weird.</font>

258
00:17:13,970 --> 00:17:15,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

259
00:17:15,380 --> 00:17:16,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

260
00:17:16,300 --> 00:17:18,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We're staying here tonight!</font>

261
00:17:18,300 --> 00:17:21,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?! I can still walk!</font>

262
00:17:21,520 --> 00:17:23,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A disciple should obey his master!</font>

263
00:17:24,140 --> 00:17:26,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I just want to learn the Jutsu!</font>

264
00:17:26,770 --> 00:17:28,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's what's called a disciple!</font>

265
00:17:29,190 --> 00:17:30,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?!</font>

266
00:17:40,370 --> 00:17:43,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, oh...!</font>

267
00:17:49,080 --> 00:17:50,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

268
00:17:50,960 --> 00:17:51,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes?</font>

269
00:17:53,300 --> 00:17:54,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here, this is the key to the room.</font>

270
00:17:54,880 --> 00:17:56,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Go to the room ahead of me,
practice Chakra,</font>

271
00:17:56,630 --> 00:17:58,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">train some and go to sleep!</font>

272
00:17:58,210 --> 00:18:00,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Got it?!
— What?!</font>

273
00:18:00,280 --> 00:18:02,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">"The adult world is gonna begin
from this point on"...</font>

274
00:18:02,510 --> 00:18:04,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is that the vibe, Pervy Sage?!
That's not fair!</font>

275
00:18:05,850 --> 00:18:08,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That post town isn't that far...!</font>

276
00:18:11,690 --> 00:18:15,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This! Somehow this always happens
when I'm with that Pervy Sage!</font>

277
00:18:19,070 --> 00:18:19,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn...</font>

278
00:18:21,620 --> 00:18:22,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here...</font>

279
00:18:28,920 --> 00:18:30,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"><b>{\an8}"Missed"</b></font>

280
00:18:30,130 --> 00:18:31,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Candies are here!</font>

281
00:18:34,840 --> 00:18:36,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've got to check door by door!</font>

282
00:18:37,590 --> 00:18:38,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Cheers!</font>

283
00:18:39,930 --> 00:18:43,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wonder if he really has any inclination
to oversee my training?</font>

284
00:18:52,440 --> 00:18:54,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What about that one? Yeah that.</font>

285
00:18:57,860 --> 00:19:00,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">See! A hundred out of a hundred!</font>

286
00:19:00,910 --> 00:19:03,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do you have a blond kid with
a dumb-looking face, about my age</font>

287
00:19:04,080 --> 00:19:06,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and a big white-haired old man
staying here?</font>

288
00:19:07,120 --> 00:19:09,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is an inn for women only...</font>

289
00:19:14,170 --> 00:19:15,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm looking for someone...</font>

290
00:19:15,590 --> 00:19:17,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do you have a blond kid with
a dumb-looking face, about my age</font>

291
00:19:18,050 --> 00:19:19,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and a big white-haired old man
staying here?</font>

292
00:19:19,340 --> 00:19:20,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Today, we only have old people.</font>

293
00:19:26,850 --> 00:19:30,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hmm... this is kind of crisp
on the tongue...</font>

294
00:19:36,530 --> 00:19:40,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, why are you guys all sleeping?</font>

295
00:19:40,700 --> 00:19:44,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do you have a blond kid with
a dumb-looking face, about my age</font>

296
00:19:44,370 --> 00:19:46,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and a big white-haired old man
staying here?</font>

297
00:19:46,910 --> 00:19:48,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">White-haired...?</font>

298
00:19:48,250 --> 00:19:49,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are they here?!</font>

299
00:19:49,370 --> 00:19:52,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Eh... Do I remember seeing
some people like that earlier</font>

300
00:19:52,670 --> 00:19:53,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">when shifts changed...?</font>

301
00:19:55,290 --> 00:19:59,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This tastes bitter...
are you all right with it? Cheers!</font>

302
00:20:00,420 --> 00:20:03,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh! A blond kid and
a white-haired old man!</font>

303
00:20:03,680 --> 00:20:05,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They're here?!
What's their room number!</font>

304
00:20:06,220 --> 00:20:08,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Um...</font>

305
00:20:08,270 --> 00:20:10,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Room number one at
the end of the hallway</font>

306
00:20:10,270 --> 00:20:11,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">on the second floor...</font>

307
00:20:26,240 --> 00:20:29,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's up?
Has she already dumped you?</font>

308
00:20:31,080 --> 00:20:32,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay, okay!</font>

309
00:20:35,170 --> 00:20:37,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay, okay, I'll open up!</font>

310
00:20:38,750 --> 00:20:39,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

311
00:20:44,890 --> 00:20:46,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's not him...</font>

312
00:21:09,710 --> 00:21:14,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">gaman no renzoku dattaro</font></font></b></font>

313
00:21:09,710 --> 00:21:14,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">a cycle of hardship, right?</font></font></b></font>

314
00:21:14,670 --> 00:21:19,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">kokoro de naiteita ndarou</font></font></b></font>

315
00:21:14,670 --> 00:21:19,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">inside, we were crying, right?</font></font></b></font>

316
00:21:19,720 --> 00:21:27,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">jibun de kimeta sono yume dake wa yuzurenai ndarou</font></font></b></font>

317
00:21:19,720 --> 00:21:27,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">but the one thing we won't give up is the dream we've chosen, right?</font></font></b></font>

318
00:21:27,770 --> 00:21:30,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">wakiyaku dakedo</font></font></b></font>

319
00:21:27,770 --> 00:21:30,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">it's a secondary role</font></font></b></font>

320
00:21:33,580 --> 00:21:36,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">kage no hito dakedo</font></font></b></font>

321
00:21:33,580 --> 00:21:36,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">a role in the shadows</font></font></b></font>

322
00:21:36,980 --> 00:21:42,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">yume to mukiau toki kurai</font></font></b></font>

323
00:21:36,980 --> 00:21:42,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">but in reaching for that dream</font></font></b></font>

324
00:21:42,120 --> 00:21:47,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">man naka ni isasete shoujiki ni isasete</font></font></b></font>

325
00:21:42,120 --> 00:21:47,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">let us stay centered, let us stay true</font></font></b></font>

326
00:21:47,960 --> 00:21:52,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">ima made nandomo nan toka akiramezu ni</font></font></b></font>

327
00:21:47,960 --> 00:21:52,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">over and over, we hung on without giving up</font></font></b></font>

328
00:21:52,730 --> 00:21:57,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">ima made nandomo tachi agatte kita janai ka</font></font></b></font>

329
00:21:52,730 --> 00:21:57,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">over and over, we kept coming back up</font></font></b></font>

330
00:21:57,430 --> 00:21:59,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">ima made nandomo</font></font></b></font>

331
00:21:57,430 --> 00:22:07,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">over and over, we believed and dreamed</font></font></b></font>

332
00:21:59,740 --> 00:22:00,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">bokura</font></font></b></font>

333
00:22:00,670 --> 00:22:02,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">nandomo</font></font></b></font>

334
00:22:02,040 --> 00:22:03,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">shinjite</font></font></b></font>

335
00:22:03,270 --> 00:22:04,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">nandomo</font></font></b></font>

336
00:22:04,610 --> 00:22:07,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">yume mite nandomo</font></font></b></font>

337
00:22:07,550 --> 00:22:12,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">ima made nandomo baka o mite kita janai ka</font></font></b></font>

338
00:22:07,550 --> 00:22:12,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">over and over, we've seen fools</font></font></b></font>

339
00:22:12,750 --> 00:22:18,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">ima made nandomo hito no kage ni tatte kita janai ka</font></font></b></font>

340
00:22:12,750 --> 00:22:18,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">over and over, we've stood in the shadows of others</font></font></b></font>

341
00:22:19,790 --> 00:22:29,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">saa shuyaku da yo jibun no yume kurai wagamama de isasete</font></font></b></font>

342
00:22:19,790 --> 00:22:29,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">now, it's our turn... let us bask in our dreams</font></font></b></font>

343
00:22:37,830 --> 00:22:44,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Damn it! My body is frozen!
What is this creepy feeling?</font>

344
00:22:44,630 --> 00:22:47,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">This guy is absolutely not
an ordinary person.</font>

345
00:22:48,010 --> 00:22:50,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">He's got the same Sharingan
as Sasuke.</font>

346
00:22:50,550 --> 00:22:52,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">He's a member of Uchiha clan.</font>

347
00:22:52,800 --> 00:22:57,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Is this the guy Sasuke
was talking about?</font>

348
00:22:59,020 --> 00:23:02,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Next time:
"Growl Chidori, Roar Sasuke!"</font>

